# UI Components
Base-level interactive elements used throughout the application.
## Button Component
**Location:** `UI::ButtonComponent`
### Variants
- `:primary` - Tokyo Night blue background (default)
- `:ghost` - Transparent with border
- `:link` - Underlined link style
### Parameters
- `variant:` - Button style (symbol)
- `size:` - Size variant (`:sm`, `:md`, `:lg`)
- `href:` - Optional URL (renders as `<a>` tag)
  - HTML attributes passed through
  ### Usage
  ```erb
  <%= render UI::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :primary) do %>
    Click Me
  <% end %>
  <%= render UI::ButtonComponent.new(variant: :ghost, href: "/path") do %>
    Link Button
  <% end %>
  ```
  ### Previews
  <%= embed "ui/button/primary" %>
  <%= embed "ui/button/ghost" %>
  ## Badge Component
  **Location:** `UI::BadgeComponent`
  ### Variants
  - `:default` - Blue background
  - `:success` - Green background
  - `:warning` - Orange background
  - `:error` - Red background
  ### Parameters
  - `variant:` - Badge color scheme (symbol)
  - Content passed as block or `text:` parameter
  ### Usage
  ```erb
  <%= render UI::BadgeComponent.new(variant: :success) do %>
    Active
  <% end %>
  ```
  ### Preview
  <%= embed "ui/badge/showcase" %>
  ## Icon Component
  **Location:** `UI::IconComponent`
  ### Parameters
  - `name:` - Font Awesome icon name (symbol)
  - `style:` - `:solid` or `:brands`
  - `size:` - Size class (`:sm`, `:md`, `:lg`, `:xl`)
  ### Icon Sets
  **Solid:** Standard icons (`:envelope`, `:user`, `:check`)
  **Brands:** Brand logos (`:github`, `:linkedin`, `:twitter`)
  ### Usage
  ```erb
  <%= render UI::IconComponent.new(name: :github, style: :brands) %>
  <%= render UI::IconComponent.new(name: :envelope, style: :solid, size: :lg) %>
  ```
  ### Previews
  <%= embed "ui/icon/solid" %>
  <%= embed "ui/icon/brands" %>
  ## Link Component
  **Location:** `UI::LinkComponent`
  Styled anchor tags with hover effects and optional icons.
  ### Parameters
  - `href:` - Destination URL
  - `variant:` - Style variant
  - HTML attributes supported
  ### Usage
  ```erb
  <%= render UI::LinkComponent.new(href: "/about") do %>
    Learn More
  <% end %>
  ```
